<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Ancient nutrient solution dispenser -->
  <AncientNutrientDispenser.label>古代營養液分配器</AncientNutrientDispenser.label>
  <!-- EN: The ancient nutrient solution dispenser was used to process and convert nutrient ointments into nutrient solutions, and then transport nutrient solutions for hydroponic cultivation through a pipeline system. Its core components have disappeared, but some are still intact. Perhaps destroying it can yield some useful things. -->
  <AncientNutrientDispenser.description>一種古代的營養液分配器，用于將營養膏加工并轉化為營養液，然后通過管道系統運輸營養液用于水培。它的核心部件已經消失，但有些仍然完好無損。也許摧毀它可以獲得一些有用的東西。</AncientNutrientDispenser.description>
  
</LanguageData>